# Extended patterns for scripts/check_public_safe.sh.
#
# One POSIX extended regex per line. Blank lines and lines starting with `#`
# are skipped. Every tracked or staged file is searched for every pattern,
# including the check script itself.
#
# This file is the tracked template and holds placeholders only. Copy it to
# `.public-safety-patterns` -- gitignored, never committed -- and replace each
# placeholder with the real string:
#
#     cp .public-safety-patterns.example .public-safety-patterns
#
# Keep the real values out of every tracked file, this template included.
# Matching is case-sensitive; add a case-insensitive alternation, or a
# character class such as [Nn]ame, where a document might vary the casing.

<author-first-name>
<private-sibling-repo-name>
<personal-email-localpart>
